tion-capture/13997234/state.json" "file_sha256" "bb9869382d80095791b986edd2e43e054b3cda8e795dda9bbb5c6b8f284256e1"} {"question" "q-120368" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13997234/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "a06f9638e301db5860430d86480821184377919789e5d1d7ce4af4d35a2c982f"} {"question" "q-120368" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13997234/state.json" "file_sha256" "bb9869382d80095791b986edd2e43e054b3cda8e795dda9bbb5c6b8f284256e1"} {"question" "q-120368" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-\\frac{1}{2}"] ["math" "-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}"] ["math" "-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{2}"] ["math" "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13997234/state.json" "file_sha256" "bb9869382d80095791b986edd2e43e054b3cda8e795dda9bbb5c6b8f284256e1"} {"question" "q-120368" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13997234/state.json" "file_sha256" "bb9869382d80095791b986edd2e43e054b3cda8e795dda9bbb5c6b8f284256e1"} {"question" "q-275706" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find the **exact** value of the expression below.\n\n${cos}^{4}⁡({15}^{∘})-2{cos}^{2}⁡({15}^{∘}){sin}^{2}⁡({15}^{∘})+{sin}^{4}⁡({15}^{∘})=$\n{{field-1}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13997234/state.json" "file_sha256" "bb9869382d80095791b986edd2e43e054b3cda8e795dda9bbb5c6b8f284256e1"} {"question" "q-275706" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, notice that our expression is a perfect square that can be rewritten as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{cos}^{4}⁡({15}^{∘})-2{cos}^{2}⁡({15}^{∘}){sin}^{2}⁡({15}^{∘})+{sin}^{4}⁡({15}^{∘}) & ={({cos}^{2}⁡({15}^{∘})-{sin}^{2}⁡({15}^{∘}))}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, let's recall the double-angle formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n{cos}^{2}⁡x-{sin}^{2}⁡x=\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x={15}^{∘}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{cos}^{2}⁡({15}^{∘})-{sin}^{2}⁡({15}^{∘}) & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2\\cdot {15}^{∘}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡({30}^{∘}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{({cos}^{2}⁡({15}^{∘})-{sin}^{2}⁡({15}^{∘}))}^{2} & ={(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2})}^{2}=\\frac{3}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13997234/state.json" "file_sha256" "bb9869382d80095791b986edd2e43e054b3cda8e795dda9bbb5c6b8f284256e1"} {"question" "q-275706" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13997234/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "a06f9638e301db5860430d86480821184377919789e5d1d7ce4af4d35a2c982f"} {"question" "q-275706" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13997234/state.json" "file_sha256" "bb9869382d80095791b986edd2e43e054b3cda8e795dda9bbb5c6b8f284256e1"} {"question" "q-275706" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{3}{4}"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13997234/state.json" "file_sha256" "bb9869382d80095791b986edd2e43e054b3cda8e795dda9bbb5c6b8f284256e1"} {"question" "q-332148" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find the **exact** value of the expression below.\n\n${cos}^{4}⁡({67.5}^{∘})-2{cos}^{2}⁡({67.5}^{∘}){sin}^{2}⁡({67.5}^{∘})+{sin}^{4}⁡({67.5}^{∘})=$\n{{field-1}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13997234/state.json" "file_sha256" "bb9869382d80095791b986edd2e43e054b3cda8e795dda9bbb5c6b8f284256e1"} {"question" "q-332148" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, notice that our expression is a perfect square that can be rewritten as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{cos}^{4}⁡({67.5}^{∘})-2{cos}^{2}⁡({67.5}^{∘}){sin}^{2}⁡({67.5}^{∘})+{sin}^{4}⁡({67.5}^{∘}) & ={({cos}^{2}⁡({67.5}^{∘})-{sin}^{2}⁡({67.5}^{∘}))}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, let's recall the double-angle formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n{cos}^{2}⁡x-{sin}^{2}⁡x=\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x={67.5}^{∘}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{cos}^{2}⁡({67.5}^{∘})-{sin}^{2}⁡({67.5}^{∘}) & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2\\cdot {67.5}^{∘}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡({135}^{∘}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{({cos}^{2}⁡({67.5}^{∘})-{sin}^{2}⁡({67.5}^{∘}))}^{2} & ={(-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2})}^{2}=\\frac{1}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13997234/state.json" "file_sha256" "bb9869382d80095791b986edd2e43e054b3cda8e795dda9bbb5c6b8f284256e1"} {"question" "q-332148" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13997234/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "a06f9638e301db5860430d86480821184377919789e5d1d7ce4af4d35a2c982f"} {"question" "q-332148" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "a